OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie prison chaplain named
OL,4,Anext Church of Scotland moderator
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chaplain of Scotland's biggest
OL,7,Fprison has been named the next
OL,8,Fmoderator of the Church of Scotland.
OL,10,FRev Jill Clancy will become the Kirk's
OL,11,Fambassador at home and abroad next May,
OL,12,Fsucceeding the current moderator, Rev
OL,13,FGordon Kennedy.
OL,15,FThe 56-year-old has spent nine years
OL,16,Fworking at HMP Barlinnie in Glasgow and
OL,17,Fpreviously served as a parish minister
OL,18,Fin Gourock, Glasgow and Ayrshire.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
