OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie prison chaplain named
OL,4,Anext Church of Scotland moderator
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as being the first prison
OL,7,Fchaplain to hold the post, Clancy - who
OL,8,Fheard she was nominated for the role
OL,9,Fwhile on holiday in Benidorm - will
OL,10,Fbecome only the seventh female
OL,11,Fmoderator in the Church's 466-year
OL,12,Fhistory.
